title: "Mobile AI Factory"
abstract: >-
  Code for "Mobile AI Factory: Building Specialized Language Models for Your Mobile Device":
  an LLM-orchestrated pipeline that curates data, fine-tunes, quantizes and evaluates small
  language models for a target phone, plus the on-device benchmarking harness.
